--- !u!114 &2546863787795794770
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7973553324472365034}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4fa92e8f507d07645aef290a87ea38ea, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InformerNpc
  npc: {fileID: 69827278817561664}
  replicas:
  - Greetings, traveler! I've got some valuable information for you...
  - Ah, a curious traveler! What would you like to know?
  - Knowledge is worth more than gold, my friend...
  - I've heard a thing or two along these roads. Interested?
  - The roads carry more than merchants. They carry secrets too...
  - Looking for answers, traveler? You've come to the right person!
  - 'A wise merchant knows that information is just as valuable as goods...  '
  - News travels fast in these lands. Care to hear the latest?
  - I've got a few tales worth sharing, if you've got the coin...
  - Fortune favors the well-informed, traveler. What interests you?
  - These lands are full of surprises. Best to know what's ahead!
  - A little knowledge can save you a lot of trouble on the road...
  weatherBasePrice: 1
  springWeatherPrice: 0
  summerWeahterPrice: 0
  fallWeatherPrice: 0
  witnerWheaterPrice: 0
  weatherForecastText:
  - Ah, the {season} lands! Word is, {weather} will last for another {hours} hours.
  - I've traveled these roads long enough to know. Expect {weather} in {season} for
    the next {hours} hours.
  - Whispers from {season} speak of {weather}. The skies should remain this way for
    another {hours} hours.
  - 'Latest news from {season}: {weather}. These conditions are expected to last
    another {hours} hours.'
  - A merchant fresh from {season} brought word of {weather}. Seems the skies won't
    change for another {hours} hours.
  - Heading toward {season}, are you? Better prepare for {weather}. It'll be another
    {hours} hours before things change.
  tradeDealsText:
  - 'A traveler fresh from {season} brought interesting news.

    <b>{highSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{highResource}</b> is worth {highPrice} coins.

    <b>{lowSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{lowResource}</b> can be bought for just {lowPrice} coins.'
  - 'I''ve heard some promising trade rumors from the {season} lands.

    <b>{highSettlement}</b>:
    Merchants are paying {highPrice} coins for <b>{highResource}</b>.

    <b>{lowSettlement}</b>:
    You can find <b>{lowResource}</b> for only {lowPrice} coins.'
  - 'Ah, {season}! There are a few opportunities worth knowing about.

    <b>{highSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{highResource}</b> fetches a fine price of {highPrice} coins.

    <b>{lowSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{lowResource}</b> is selling for just {lowPrice} coins.'
  - 'Word travels fast along the roads of {season}. Here''s what I''ve heard.

    <b>{highSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{highResource}</b> is in high demand, fetching {highPrice} coins.

    <b>{lowSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{lowResource}</b> is plentiful, costing only {lowPrice} coins.'
  - 'Fortune favors those who know where to trade. Here''s the latest from {season}.

    <b>{highSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{highResource}</b> commands a price of {highPrice} coins.

    <b>{lowSettlement}</b>:
    <b>{lowResource}</b> can be found for a mere {lowPrice} coins.'
  - 'Looking to make some coin? I''ve picked up a few tips from {season}.

    <b>{highSettlement}</b>:
    Traders offer {highPrice} coins for <b>{highResource}</b>.

    <b>{lowSettlement}</b>:
    Merchants sell <b>{lowResource}</b> for just {lowPrice} coins.'
